{
  "bodyHash": "9894c00e552eb843",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gWjwWXv/calcmodsmall.png\" alt=\"CalcMod Logo\"><a href=\"https://github.com/js802025/calcmod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcalcmod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">透過 CalcMod 將計算的力量帶入你的 Minecraft 聊天視窗！探索一系列專為休閒與硬核玩家設計的功能，從基礎運算到優化遊戲體驗的進階工具應有盡有。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#e03e2d\">CalcMod 在 Modrinth 上的更新更為頻繁</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcalcmod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\" width=\"119\" height=\"116\"></a></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>/calc craft piston 3 sb</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/sQ0S9rP/Calc-Craft.png\" alt=\"製作功能範例\" width=\"405\" height=\"114\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>/calc nether ~ ~ ~</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vPZwWRw/Calc-Nether.png\" alt=\"X: -120 Z: 4500 轉換至下界 = X: -15 Z: 563\" width=\"407\" height=\"28\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><em>點擊 <span style=\"color:#0f0\">任何</span> 綠色文字即可複製到剪貼簿！</em></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>功能：</strong></span></h1>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🟢 基礎計算機</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">像簡單計算機一樣運作，並提供一些實用的變數。若要查看變數列表，請執行 /calc variables。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc {表達式}</code></span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">📦&nbsp;儲存工具</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">根據每小時物品處理速率（<em>可輸入表達式</em>）計算所需物品分類器的數量。支援輸入漏斗速度的倍數，以及專為悅靈（Allay）基於非堆疊物品的分類器設計的獨立指令。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc storage {每小時物品數}</code></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 用法：<code>/calc storage {漏斗速度倍數} {每小時物品數}</code></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 用法：<code>/calc allaystorage {每小時物品數}</code><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🛠️&nbsp;製作工具</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">根據目標物品與想要製作的數量，回傳製作該數量所需的原材料數量。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc craft {物品} {數量}</code></span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🌐&nbsp;傳送門座標</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">根據方塊位置回傳另一個維度的對應座標。若未提供座標，指令會以當前玩家位置為準。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc nether {x} {y} {z}</code></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 用法：<code>/calc overworld {x} {y} {z}</code></span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🌾&nbsp;農場產率計算機</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">根據物品數量與 AFK 時間（秒）（<em>可輸入表達式</em>），回傳每小時的物品產量。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc rates {物品數量} {時間(秒)}</code></span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🎲&nbsp;產生隨機數字</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">根據最大值與/或最小值，回傳介於兩者之間的隨機數字（含端點）。若僅輸入最大值，則會從 0 到最大值之間隨機選取一個數字（含端點）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc random {最大值}</code></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 用法：<code>/calc random minmax {最小值} {最大值}</code></span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">💪&nbsp;比較器強度計算機</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">根據容器類型與目標比較器訊號強度，回傳達成該訊號強度所需的物品數量。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc signaltoitems {容器} {訊號強度}</code></span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🐷&nbsp;豬布林交易工具<span style=\"color:#f00\">（新增）</span></span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">計算為了獲得指定數量的目標物品 <em>(togold)</em> 平均需要交易多少金錠，或計算交易指定數量的金錠 <em>(toitem)</em> 平均能獲得多少物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc barter togold {物品數量} {物品}</code></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 用法：<code>/calc barter toitem {金錠數量} {物品}</code></span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🧮&nbsp;自訂函式 <span style=\"color:#f00\">（新增）</span></span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">自訂函式是可重複使用的指令，用於執行特定運算。自訂函式可在任何數值欄位中以 <code>customfunction(param1, paramN)</code> 的格式執行。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 建立函式時，參數可透過 [方括號] 指定任意數量。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>建立你的函式：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> <code>/calc custom add blockstoingots [num-blocks]*9</code></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>/calc blockstoingots(72)</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FK35cqK/CalcFn.png\" alt=\"blockstoingots(72) = 648\" width=\"393\" height=\"27\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc custom add {名稱} {函式}</code></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 用法：<code>/calc custom run {名稱} {輸入值}</code></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 用法：<code>/calc {名稱}({參數})</code></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 用法：<code>/calc custom list</code></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 用法：<code>/calc custom remove {名稱}</code></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>➡️ 轉換器：</strong></span></h3>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">潛影盒 &harr; 物品</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">根據滿載潛影盒的數量（<em>可輸入表達式</em>），回傳對應的物品數量，反之亦然。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc itemtosb {物品數量}</code></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 用法：<code>/calc sbtoitem {潛影盒數量}</code><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">物品 &harr; 堆疊：</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">根據物品數量（<em>可輸入表達式</em>），回傳堆疊數量與剩餘物品數，反之亦然。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc itemtostack {物品數量}</code></span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"> 用法：<code>/calc stacktoitem {堆疊數量}</code></span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">秒數 &rarr; 漏斗計時器物品數</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">根據秒數（<em>可輸入表達式</em>），回傳在漏斗計時器中達成該時間所需的物品數量。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc secondstohopperclock {秒數}</code></span></p>\n</div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">秒數 &rarr; 延遲器延遲時間</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">根據秒數（<em>可輸入表達式</em>），回傳所需的延遲器數量與各自的延遲設定。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">用法：<code>/calc secondstorepeater {秒數}</code></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><em>除了 Minecraft 相關功能外，CalcMod 還提供了大量進階函式與變數，可在此試算表中查看 <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1L3jCFO6ZiUymXbRJKOJIWGpcOQjfvU3TpCcFPeUJDNA/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>（以防你需要計算反雙曲餘切來玩 Minecraft）。</em></span></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>❎ 變數</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">變數可用於任何數值欄位的公式中。它們可作為快捷方式，讓你無需死記「一個放滿 16 組可堆疊物品的雙層箱子等於 864」。若未指定堆疊大小，變數預設為各指令中的堆疊大小。</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">常量變數：</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">常量變數代表固定不變的數值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>名稱：</strong> 數值 </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>dub：</strong> 3456（預設） </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>dub64：</strong> 3456 </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>dub16：</strong> 864 </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>dub1：</strong> 54 </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>sb：</strong> 1728（預設） </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>sb64：</strong> 1728 </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>sb16：</strong> 432 </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>sb1：</strong> 27 </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>stack：</strong> 64（預設） </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>stack64：</strong> 64 </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>stack16：</strong> 16 </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>stack1：</strong> 1 </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>min：</strong> 60 </span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>h：</strong> 3600</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">動態變數：</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">動態變數會根據遊戲內的狀態而改變。這些變數在自訂函式中特別實用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>名稱：</strong> 數值</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>x：</strong> 玩家 X 軸座標</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>y：</strong> 玩家 Y 軸座標</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>z：</strong> 玩家 Z 軸座標</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>health：</strong> 玩家生命值</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
